; POOL EXTENSION (sl-0200): CROSS BEAMS — a four-arm world-frame
; cross (0/90/180/270), two staggered speeds per arm (3.6 / 4.8), on
; a slow ROTOR (0.8°/tick): the cross sweeps the room like a
; lighthouse and the quadrant gaps WALK. Two emitters of this one
; pattern firing at different ticks lace a checker (rotor angle is a
; pure function of the fire tick). Room-pattern language. Pattern
; id 45; lead 36 (the radial danger class). Elite amber placeholder;
; identity data-keyed.

